<div class="pgs-wrap">

  <div class="pgs-hero">
    <p class="pgs-eyebrow">Support</p>
    <h1 class="pgs-heading">Frequently asked questions</h1>
    <p class="pgs-subhead">Can&rsquo;t find what you need? <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/contact" class="pgs-link">Write to us</a> &mdash; we reply within one business day.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="pgs-content">

    <div class="pgs-faq-group">
      <h2 class="pgs-faq-group__title">The Product</h2>
      <div class="faq-list" role="list">

        <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq-item__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-item__question">What exactly is DeskPaws?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p class="faq-item__body">DeskPaws is a padded basket that clamps directly to your desk edge. It gives your cat a comfortable, elevated spot beside you &mdash; close enough to satisfy them, out of the way enough that you can actually work. No tools. No drilling. No permanent attachment. No marks on your desk.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq-item__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-item__question">What is it made of?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p class="faq-item__body">The frame is powder-coated steel. The basket is woven for airflow. The cushion is a removable sherpa pad &mdash; soft, warm, and washable. The G-clamp has rubber padding on every contact point to protect your desk surface.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq-item__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-item__question">What weight can it hold?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p class="faq-item__body">The steel frame supports up to 50&nbsp;lbs (22&nbsp;kg), which comfortably handles larger breeds including Maine Coons. The woven basket distributes weight evenly so there&rsquo;s no flex or wobble.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq-item__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-item__question">Will my cat actually use it?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p class="faq-item__body">Most cats claim their DeskPaws within the first day. The key is placement &mdash; position it at the height they already gravitate toward, add a pinch of catnip, and let them discover it at their own pace. Cats are naturally drawn to elevated, semi-enclosed spaces near their person. That&rsquo;s exactly what this provides. If yours is the exception, our 30-day guarantee covers you.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq-item__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-item__question">How do I clean it?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p class="faq-item__body">Remove the sherpa cushion and hand-wash in cold water with a mild, pet-safe detergent. Lay flat to air dry &mdash; do not tumble dry. The metal frame and basket wipe clean with a damp cloth.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pgs-faq-group">
      <h2 class="pgs-faq-group__title">Desk Compatibility &amp; Installation</h2>
      <div class="faq-list" role="list">

        <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq-item__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-item__question">What desks does it work with?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p class="faq-item__body">DeskPaws works on most straight-edged desks: solid wood, laminate, marble, and metal, up to approximately 2&Prime; (5&nbsp;cm) thick. It doesn&rsquo;t work well on desks with unusual edge profiles, very thin glass tops, or heavily curved edges. Standing desks work at a fixed height &mdash; just let your cat hop out before you adjust it. Not sure about yours? <a href="mailto:hello@deskpaws.com" class="pgs-link">Email us</a> and we&rsquo;ll give you a straight answer.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq-item__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-item__question">How long does installation take?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p class="faq-item__body">About 60 seconds. Slide the padded clamp onto the desk edge, hand-tighten the knob until firm, set the basket, add the cushion. No tools, no instruction manual.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq-item__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-item__question">Will it damage my desk surface?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p class="faq-item__body">No. The clamp has soft rubber pads on every surface that contacts your desk. We&rsquo;ve tested it on wood, marble, and metal finishes with no marks.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq-item__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-item__question">Is it stable when my cat jumps in?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p class="faq-item__body">Yes. The steel clamp locks onto the desk and doesn&rsquo;t shift under impact. The woven basket distributes weight evenly. We have had no reports of wobble even from heavier cats landing suddenly.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pgs-faq-group">
      <h2 class="pgs-faq-group__title">Shipping &amp; Returns</h2>
      <div class="faq-list" role="list">

        <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq-item__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-item__question">How long does shipping take?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p class="faq-item__body">We process orders within 1&ndash;2 business days. Estimated delivery to US addresses is 7&ndash;14 business days from dispatch. You&rsquo;ll receive a tracking number by email as soon as your order ships.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq-item__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-item__question">Do you ship internationally?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p class="faq-item__body">We currently ship to the United States and Canada. If you&rsquo;re located elsewhere and interested, email us &mdash; we&rsquo;re working on expanding.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq-item__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-item__question">What is your return policy?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p class="faq-item__body">We offer a 30-day return window from the date of delivery. If DeskPaws isn&rsquo;t the right fit, contact us and we&rsquo;ll arrange a full refund. Returns are subject to the product being in reasonable condition.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item" role="listitem">
          <button class="faq-item__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-item__question">My order arrived damaged. What should I do?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p class="faq-item__body">Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@deskpaws.com" class="pgs-link">hello@deskpaws.com</a> with your order number and a photo of the damage. We&rsquo;ll arrange a replacement or a refund &mdash; whichever you prefer.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="pgs-cta">
    <p class="pgs-cta__text">&ldquo;She was in it before my coffee was ready.&rdquo;</p>
    <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}products/desk-paws-place-for-your-cat-co-worker" class="btn btn--secondary">
      Shop DeskPaws &mdash; $79
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19.6293 4.46929C15.1122 2.22992 14.0195 0 14.0195 0V5.05512H0V6.94488H14.0098V12H14.0195C14.0195 12 15.1122 9.75118 19.6293 7.52126C21.0732 6.80315 22.5561 6.33071 24 6C22.5561 5.66929 21.0732 5.19685 19.6293 4.47874V4.46929Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
    </a>
  </div>

</div>

